'''Wells''' are [[building]]s that provide access to a [[water]] source for your dwarves. A well can be an important feature of a fortress.

== Building a well ==
A mason/carpenter/metalsmith is needed for construction. Alternatively, you can make rock mechanisms using the {{k|d}}etail function at a [[mechanic's workshop]].

=== Placement ===
Wells must have a clear vertical pathway straight down to their water source.

